{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for gentle, safety-first aromatherapy sessions, events, and consults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.'>
  <style>
    :root{--bg-1:#fbf9f6;--bg-2:#f3f6f5;--accent:#6b7c6f;--muted:#8b8b8b;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);--shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(41,50,34,0.06);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));color:#203225;line-height:1.45}
    /* subtle topography and pattern via inline SVG element placed in DOM */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14}
    header{position:relative;z-index:5;padding:28px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf3ea,#dfeef5);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}
    .hero{position:relative;z-index:3;padding:48px 24px 32px;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--glass));border-radius:14px;padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    h1{font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,34px);margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6b7c6f,#95a98a);color:white;text-decoration:none}
    /* diagnostic */
    .diagnostic{margin-top:18px;background:transparent}
    .diag-list{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .pill{background:#fff7ee;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font-size:14px;color:#5a5a4f}

    /* plan */
    .plan{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .plan .tile{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(34,40,34,0.04)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* micro habits */
    .micro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:18px 0}
    .habit{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfdfc);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font-size:14px}

    /* pricing */
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    .price-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbfb);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;min-width:160px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

    /* contact form */
    form{margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(32,50,34,0.06)}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e7e7e5;background:transparent}
    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .submit{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6b7c6f,#95a98a);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:10px}
    footer{padding:28px 24px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} .micro{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)} .row{grid-template-columns:1fr} nav a{margin-left:12px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='pattern-wrap' aria-hidden='true'>
    <!-- decorative SVG pattern, unique to this template, softly tiled -->
    <svg width='100%' height='100%' viewBox='0 0 1200 800' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id='g' x1='0' x2='1'>
          <stop offset='0' stop-color='#eaf3ea'/>
          <stop offset='1' stop-color='#f3f6f5'/>
        </linearGradient>
        <pattern id='p' width='120' height='120' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
          <rect width='120' height='120' fill='url(#g)' />
          <circle cx='20' cy='20' r='2' fill='#dfe8df' />
          <circle cx='100' cy='100' r='2' fill='#dfe8df' />
          <path d='M0 60 C30 30 90 30 120 60' stroke='#eef6ec' stroke-width='1.4' fill='none' opacity='0.9'/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p)' />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>A</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class='muted' style='font-size:13px'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
      <a href='blends.html'>Blends</a>
      <a href='shop.html'>Shop</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='contact.html' style='color:var(--accent)'>Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main role='main' class='hero'>
    <div class='hero-grid'>
      <section class='hero-card'>
        <h1>Send a note, share a scent, start a series</h1>
        <p class='lead'>I’m {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}. I hold gentle, safety-first space for curiosity, ritual, and scent-led gatherings. Tell me what you need and we’ll shape a plan together.</p>
        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>

        <div class='diagnostic' aria-labelledby='diag-title'>
          <h3 id='diag-title' style='margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:6px'>Quick scent diagnostic</h3>
          <p class='muted'>A few notes to help me match a safe, aromatic path—no medical promises, just care.</p>
          <div class='diag-list'>
            <div class='pill'>Preference: woodsy, citrus, floral, fresh, or resin?</div>
            <div class='pill'>Context: one-time consult, private session, or an events series?</div>
            <div class='pill'>Safety flags: pregnancy, pets at home, sensitive skin?</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='plan' aria-labelledby='plan-title'>
          <div>
            <h4 id='plan-title' style='margin:10px 0 6px'>A simple plan</h4>
            <div class='tile'><strong>Intro Consult</strong><div class='muted'>30–45 min, intake & preferences</div></div>
            <div class='tile' style='margin-top:8px'><strong>Single Session</strong><div class='muted'>Custom blend and ritual guidance</div></div>
            <div class='tile' style='margin-top:8px'><strong>Events Series</strong><div class='muted'>Recurring group sessions and blend education</div></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style='margin:10px 0 6px'>Safety-first notes</h4>
            <p class='muted'>I include dilution guidance, patch-test steps, and careful consideration for pregnancy and pets. We prioritize comfort and transparency.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class='hero-card'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Micro rituals that travel</h3>
          <p class='muted' style='margin:0 0 10px'>Tiny habits that make scent part of the day.</p>
          <div class='micro'>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Roll-on 1</strong><div class='muted'>Morning citrus for bright intention</div></div>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Deep breath</strong><div class='muted'>Three slow inhales before a pause</div></div>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Pillow mist</strong><div class='muted'>A spritz for predictable bedtime ritual</div></div>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Diffuser minute</strong><div class='muted'>10–20 min at low volume for shared spaces</div></div>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Patch check</strong><div class='muted'>Spot test a new blend before full use</div></div>
            <div class='habit'><strong>Shelf rotation</strong><div class='muted'>Swap a bottle weekly to rediscover notes</div></div>
          </div>

          <h4 style='margin-top:12px'>Pricing snapshot</h4>
          <div class='pricing'>
            <div class='price-card'><strong>Intro</strong><div class='muted'>$55 • 30–45m</div></div>
            <div class='price-card'><strong>Session</strong><div class='muted'>$95 • 60m</div></div>
            <div class='price-card'><strong>Series</strong><div class='muted'>from $250 • events series</div></div>
          </div>
          <div style='margin-top:12px'><a href='pricing.html' class='muted' style='text-decoration:underline'>See full fees & series dates</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style='max-width:960px;margin:22px auto'>
      <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Get in touch</h3>
      <p class='muted' style='margin:0 0 12px'>Prefer text or email? Reach out at <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:underline'>{{PHONE}}</a> or <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:underline'>{{EMAIL}}</a>. Use the form below to introduce your needs.</p>

      <form id='contactForm' autocomplete='off' aria-labelledby='contact-form-title'>
        <div class='row'>
          <div>
            <label for='name'>Your name</label>
            <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='Your full name'>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@example.com'>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:10px'>
          <label for='phone'>Phone</label>
          <input id='phone' name='phone' type='text' placeholder='Optional phone number'>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:10px'>
          <label for='context'>What would you like?</label>
          <select id='context' name='context'>
            <option value='intro'>Intro consult</option>
            <option value='session'>Private session</option>
            <option value='series'>Events series</option>
            <option value='other'>Other / ask</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:10px'>
          <label for='message'>Short note</label>
          <textarea id='message' name='message' rows='4' placeholder='Tell me about scent preferences, dates, or any safety notes'></textarea>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:10px' class='small'>
          <label><input type='checkbox' id='pregnancy' name='pregnancy'> Pregnancy or trying to conceive</label><br>
          <label><input type='checkbox' id='pets' name='pets'> Pets at home (type/species)</label><br>
          <label><input type='checkbox' id='patch' name='patch'> I understand a patch test is recommended</label>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:10px'>
          <button type='submit' class='submit'>Send message</button>
        </div>

        <div id='formMessage' class='small muted' style='margin-top:8px;display:none'></div>
      </form>

      <script>
        (function(){
          var form=document.getElementById('contactForm');
          var msg=document.getElementById('formMessage');
          form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
            e.preventDefault();
            var name=form.name.value.trim();
            var email=form.email.value.trim();
            if(!name || !email){
              msg.style.display='block';
              msg.textContent='Please share your name and an email so I can reply.';
              return;
            }
            // client-side safety reminder
            var checks=[];
            if(form.pregnancy.checked) checks.push('pregnancy');
            if(form.pets.checked) checks.push('pets');
            if(form.patch.checked) checks.push('patch-test acknowledged');

            var payload={
              name:name,
              email:email,
              phone:form.phone.value.trim(),
              context:form.context.value,
              message:form.message.value.trim(),
              flags:checks
            };
            // For this static demo we only log and show a gentle confirmation.
            console.log('Contact submission',payload);
            msg.style.display='block';
            msg.textContent='Thanks, '+(name.split(' ')[0]||'friend')+" — I received your note. I will reply to " + email + ". If it’s urgent, call " + '{{PHONE}}' + '.';
            form.reset();
          });
        })();
      </script>

    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:underline'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Small gatherings and events series are available — see the events calendar on the Book page.</div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains two files for the aromatherapy site template (layoutFamily=zen_minimal, voice=minimal_poetic).

Files:
- contact.html — Contact & intake page with required sections: hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, cta. Includes an accessible contact form, client-side validation, and a decorative inline SVG pattern for visual richness (no external assets required here).

Placeholders to replace as needed:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}

Notes and integration:
- The contact form is static for the prototype: it validates client-side, logs the payload to the console, and shows a confirmation message. Hook the form to your backend or a form service if you need submissions persisted.
- Safety-forward copy is included: prompts for pregnancy, pets, and patch-test acknowledgement. Do not add medical claims in other pages.
- A unique SVG decorative pattern is embedded in contact.html. If a shared asset (assets/img/pattern.svg) is desired, replace the inline SVG with that file and update references across templates.
- Nav labels are intentionally varied and minimal; ensure consistency across other pages when you assemble the full site.

Styling:
- Self-contained CSS is in contact.html. Visual richness uses gradients, soft shadows, and the inline SVG pattern. No external fonts or CDNs are used.

Customization tips:
- Adjust pricing card numbers in the hero aside to match your current fees.
- Update the events series language in the plan section to reflect your offerModel and schedule.
- Keep language safety-first: recommend dilution, patch testing, and consultation for pregnancy or pet-related concerns.

If you need the complementary asset files (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, and assets/img/pattern.svg), request the remaining chunks and they will be produced with distinct headings, varied metaphors, and unique section orders to satisfy uniqueness requirements."}
BUNDLE_END
